# Sent with every file. Cloudflare reads this file and does not serve it.
#
# The observations are open data, read by pages on other sites, so any site may
# read them.
#
# Each file is sent with its version in ETag, which changes when the file
# does. A page on another site is let read it, so it can ask what version a
# file is at — a HEAD request — and read the file only when it has moved.
/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Access-Control-Expose-Headers: ETag
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

/*.jsonl
  Content-Type: application/x-ndjson; charset=utf-8
